  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Al-Haq, established in 1979, promote Palestinian people&#x2019;s human rights, defend them and enhance the rule of law and the culture and values of human rights, as set out in the organisation&#x2019;s Strategic Plan 2021-2026. Al-Haq influences policies, legislations and practices of duty bearers so that they become aligned with international law, contribute to effective remedy for violations of human rights, and work to enhance human rights discourse and influence the international legal jurisprudence.</narrative>
